{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100650","id":2246614220,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6F6JzM","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100650","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100650.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100650.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100650","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100650/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100650/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100650/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b711d72e8f8edf6f2619f713901c40128c8678fa","number":100650,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Remove unnecessary `friend class` declarations of `CowData`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is a small cleanup I did while doing sanity checks for #100619.\r\nThe `friend class` declarations are unnecessary. They should be removed because they increase coupling. It additionally makes no sense to have `friend` classes because `CowData` should be designed such that it can be used from any class, and not just some known specific classes.\r\n\r\nThere are only a few affected spots:\r\n\r\n`_ref()` calls can be replaced with `operator=(const CowData &)` calls. The resulting call is the exact same:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/89001f91d21ebd08b59756841426f540b154b97d/core/templates/cowdata.h#L172\r\n\r\nForward declarations can also be removed. Two headers were passively using them before (`visual_shader` and `vector`). I moved the forward declarations to the appropriate spots.\r\n\r\nFinally, I also made `_get_alloc_size` and `_get_alloc_size_checked` static. This is a small change that doesn't warrant a separate PR. It does not make sense to have the functions be member functions, because it is relied upon that allocation sizes are consistent across different instances of `CowData`. It has to be deterministic by class alone.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com